			array( 'Programme tuition and course fees', 'Tuition rates are fixed for all cohorts. The Professional Cook Diploma costs €14,800 for the full forty-week programme. The twenty-week Pastry & Bread Certificate is €7,900. Working cooks may enrol in a single ten-week term for €3,900. Short courses include our six-evening Stocks & Sauces course for €480 and the applicant kitchen trial day for €60. Dining at The Pass costs €24 for three courses or €19 for two courses.' ),
			array( 'The equipment kit and inclusions', 'All diploma and certificate students purchase a standard knife roll and whites kit for €420 upon admission. This kit contains professional high-carbon knives, sharpening steel, kitchen shears, protective sleeves, apron, branded whites, and the stainless steel saji tasting spoon. Tuition includes all cooking ingredients, daily laundering of student whites, learning materials, and the cooked staff family meal served Monday through Friday. There are no additional facility or ingredient fees.' ),
