			array( 'Location and contact information', 'Saji Culinary School is located at Veerkade 18, 3016 DE Rotterdam, Netherlands. For general inquiries, trial day bookings, or student admissions, email our administrative team at hello@saji-culinary.example or call +31 10 555 0118. Our admissions office is open Monday through Friday from 08:00 to 16:00. The Pass student restaurant welcomes dining guests Tuesday through Friday between 12:00 and 13:30.' ),
			array( 'How do I reach the school by public transport?', 'The school is easily accessible via Rotterdam public transit. A major tram stop is situated just two minutes on foot from Veerkade 18, connecting directly with Rotterdam Centraal station. Several regional bus routes stop at the nearby avenue. If traveling by bicycle, sheltered bike parking racks are located directly outside our brick warehouse doors along the canal quay. Street vehicle parking in the surrounding harbor district is metered.' ),
			array( 'Monthly open kitchen visits', 'For those considering applying to our diploma or certificate programmes, we hold an open kitchen on the first Saturday of every month from 10:00 to 13:00. Visitors can inspect our stainless steel teaching benches, explore walk-in coolers, watch live station demonstrations, and discuss course details with our chef-instructors. No appointment is necessary; simply arrive at Veerkade 18 during open hours.' ),
